abstract: "Exact rational map-error and target-cost certificates for planar affine-max transport maps; a uniform coefficient-box envelope with a proved linear-in-radius tightness bound and a convergent box-subdivision interval with feasible lower bounds; a sharp two-parameter three-atom calibration; a bounded benchmark. Unrefereed candidate; no external peer review, independent reproduction or formal verification."
